Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Viren Chauhan and I'm building Screenmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.23,0:00:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Applying for jobs means entering the same information into different
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.47,0:00:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,websites, then writing answers for each role.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Screenmate helps to do that directly on the application page.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,uses your saved background to fill forms and draft answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It checks that changes actually went through
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving personal decisions and final submissions to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,want to make applying less repetitive while
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.88,0:00:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,keeping people in control of what they send.